<title>USA: FSA qualifies Forrest Cty, Miss., GOs.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies Forrest Cty, Miss., GOs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance Tuesday said it has added an $8 million Forrest County, Miss., general obligation bond offering to the list of competitive deals it has qualified for bond insurance.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
